{"id": "2b2d98ab-a45d-4d26-9e20-c3e66e76f5a6", "slug": "a9-dynamics-engineering", "title": "A9 DYNAMICS | Engineering", "description": "Engineering Dynamics Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"A9 DYNAMICS | Engineering\"\ndescription: \"Engineering Dynamics Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#F5E51B\"\n  secondary: \"#CBD5E1\"\n  accent: \"#E62E2D\"\n  background: \"#CBD5E1\"\n  surface: \"#0F172A\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#CBD5E1\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# A9 DYNAMICS | Engineering\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Aksonvady Phomhome (@aksonvady). Views: 4; favorites: 1; remixes: 0.\nTags: section, css, layout, content, responsive.\n## Overview\nEngineering Dynamics Content Section is designed for structuring a full-width content block for landing pages. Key features include reusable layout structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready styling. Built with custom CSS, it is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\n+ + A9 Dyn Services Projects Team Contacts Engine Status Nominal Operations A9 Dyn Scroll\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: A9; Dyn.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #F5E51B, secondary #CBD5E1, accent #E62E2D, background #CBD5E1, surface #0F172A, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>A9 DYNAMICS | Engineering</title>\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- ThreeJS & GSAP -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    colors: {\n                        'brand-red': '#E62E2D',\n                        'brand-yellow': '#F5E51B',\n                        'brand-dark': '#0F172A',\n                        'brand-light': '#F8F9FA'\n                    },\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'ui-sans-serif', 'system-ui', 'sans-serif'],\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-brand-light text-brand-dark overflow-x-hidden antialiased min-h-screen relative font-sans selection:bg-brand-red selection:text-white\">\n\n    <!-- Background Grid Lines -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 flex justify-evenly w-full opacity-40\">\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full bg-gray-300\"></div>\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full bg-gray-300\"></div>\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full bg-gray-300\"></div>\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full bg-gray-300\"></div>\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full bg-gray-300 hidden md:block\"></div>\n        <div class=\"w-px h-full bg-gray-300 hidden lg:block\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Wrapper -->\n    <main class=\"relative w-full min-h-[120vh] z-10\">\n\n        <!-- Yellow Vertical Accent Strip -->\n        <div class=\"absolute right-[20%] lg:right-[30%] top-0 w-32 md:w-48 lg:w-64 h-full bg-brand-yellow z-0 hidden md:block\" style=\"mix-blend-mode: multiply;\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Decorative Elements (Crosses, Circles, Lines) -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none z-10 overflow-hidden hidden md:block\">\n            <!-- Diagonal Line 1 -->\n            <svg class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full\" style=\"transform: scale(1.5);\">\n                <line x1=\"20%\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"80%\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\" />\n            </svg>\n            <!-- Diagonal Line 2 -->\n            <svg class=\"absolute top-[20%] left-[-10%] w-full h-full\" style=\"transform: scale(1.5);\">\n                <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"50%\" x2=\"80%\" y2=\"100%\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\" />\n            </svg>\n\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[20%] right-[25%] text-brand-dark font-bold text-lg\">+</div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[35%] right-[25%] text-gray-400 font-bold text-2xl\" style=\"opacity: 0.5;\">+</div>\n\n            <!-- Red Circle Accent -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[35%] right-[10%] w-6 h-6 rounded-full border border-brand-red flex items-center justify-center\">\n                <div class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-brand-red rounded-full\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- Yellow Circle Accent -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[55%] right-[10%] w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-brand-yellow flex items-center justify-center\">\n                <div class=\"w-0 h-0 border-l-[3px] border-l-transparent border-r-[3px] border-r-transparent border-t-[4px] border-t-brand-dark\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Left Navigation Sidebar -->\n        <aside class=\"fixed md:absolute top-0 left-0 h-auto md:h-full w-full md:w-64 p-6 md:p-12 z-40 flex flex-row md:flex-col justify-between items-center md:items-start bg-brand-light md:bg-transparent border-b md:border-b-0 border-gray-200\">\n\n            <!-- Logo -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-0 md:mb-32\">\n                <div class=\"relative w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" class=\"w-full h-full fill-brand-red\">\n                        <path d=\"M12 2L2 22H22L12 2Z\" />\n                    </svg>\n                    <div class=\"absolute w-3 h-3 bg-brand-light bottom-2 z-10\" style=\"clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 0% 100%, 100% 100%);\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"font-bold text-lg tracking-tight uppercase\">A9 Dyn</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Nav Links -->\n            <nav class=\"hidden md:flex flex-col gap-10\">\n                <div class=\"relative group cursor-pointer\">\n                    <!-- Highlight Box -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute -left-4 -top-2 -bottom-2 -right-12 bg-brand-yellow z-0 transition-transform origin-left\"></div>\n                    <!-- Indicator Line -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute -left-12 top-1/2 w-4 h-[2px] bg-brand-red z-10\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"relative z-10 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-brand-dark uppercase\">Services</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"relative group cursor-pointer\">\n                    <span class=\"relative z-10 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-brand-dark uppercase hover:text-brand-red transition-colors\">Projects</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"relative group cursor-pointer\">\n                    <span class=\"relative z-10 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-brand-dark uppercase hover:text-brand-red transition-colors\">Team</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"relative group cursor-pointer\">\n                    <!-- Diagonal accent line on contact -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute -left-16 top-1/2 w-12 h-[2px] bg-brand-dark z-10\" style=\"transform: rotate(35deg);\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"relative z-10 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-brand-dark uppercase hover:text-brand-red transition-colors\">Contacts</span>\n                </div>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- Mobile Menu Icon -->\n            <button class=\"md:hidden text-2xl text-brand-dark\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n        </aside>\n\n        <!-- Premium Surface: Gradient Border Status Card -->\n        <div class=\"fixed bottom-8 left-8 md:bottom-12 md:left-12 z-50 hidden md:block\">\n            <!-- Subtle gradient border wrapper -->\n            <div class=\"p-[1px] rounded-sm bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-red/40 via-gray-300 to-transparent shadow-lg backdrop-blur-sm\">\n                <!-- Inner content -->\n                <div class=\"bg-brand-light/95 px-4 py-2 rounded-sm flex items-center gap-3\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-bolt-linear\" class=\"text-brand-red text-lg\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold text-gray-500 tracking-widest uppercase\">Engine Status</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-tight text-brand-dark\">Nominal Operations</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- ThreeJS Canvas Container -->\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-20 pointer-events-none flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden\">\n            <canvas id=\"mech-canvas\" class=\"w-full h-full opacity-90 md:opacity-100\" style=\"transform: scale(1.1) translateX(5%);\"></canvas>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Main Typography (Masked Reveal via GSAP) -->\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-[15%] right-[5%] md:right-[15%] lg:right-[20%] z-30 flex flex-col items-end pointer-events-none\">\n            <!-- Decorative red dot -->\n            <div class=\"absolute -left-12 bottom-4 w-5 h-5 bg-brand-red rounded-full hidden md:block\"></div>\n\n            <h1 class=\"text-[6rem] md:text-[10rem] lg:text-[14rem] leading-[0.8] font-bold tracking-tighter uppercase m-0 p-0 text-brand-red\" style=\"text-shadow: 2px 2px 0px rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\">\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-2\">\n                    <div class=\"reveal-word inline-block transform translate-y-[110%]\">A9</div>\n                </div>\n            </h1>\n            <h2 class=\"text-[5rem] md:text-[8rem] lg:text-[12rem] leading-[0.8] font-semibold tracking-tighter uppercase m-0 p-0 text-brand-dark relative -top-4 md:-top-8\">\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-4\">\n                    <div class=\"reveal-word inline-block transform translate-y-[110%]\">Dyn</div>\n                </div>\n            </h2>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Scroll Indicator -->\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-10 right-10 z-40 flex flex-col items-center gap-2 animate-bounce\">\n            <span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-gray-400\" style=\"writing-mode: vertical-rl;\">Scroll</span>\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-down-linear\" class=\"text-gray-400\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n        </div>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- THREE JS IMPLEMENTATION (Blueprint/Line-Art Style) ---\n        const initThreeJS = () => {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('mech-canvas');\n            if (!canvas) return;\n\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n            // Responsive Camera setup\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            camera.position.z = window.innerWidth < 768 ? 25 : 18;\n            camera.position.x = window.innerWidth < 768 ? 0 : -2;\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({\n                canvas: canvas,\n                alpha: true,\n                antialias: true\n            });\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n            // Create a complex group to represent the mechanical part\n            const mechGroup = new THREE.Group();\n\n            // Material for the lines (simulating blueprint ink)\n            const lineMaterial = new THREE.LineBasicMaterial({\n                color: 0x0f172a, // brand-dark\n                linewidth: 1,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.8\n            });\n\n            // Helper function to add edged geometry to group\n            const addBlueprintPart = (geometry, position = {x:0, y:0, z:0}, rotation = {x:0, y:0, z:0}) => {\n                const edges = new THREE.EdgesGeometry(geometry, 15); // 15 degree threshold for crisp edges\n                const line = new THREE.LineSegments(edges, lineMaterial);\n                line.position.set(position.x, position.y, position.z);\n                line.rotation.set(rotation.x, rotation.y, rotation.z);\n                mechGroup.add(line);\n                return line;\n            };\n\n            // Build the mechanical assembly\n            // Core cylinder\n            addBlueprintPart(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(2, 2, 6, 32));\n\n            // Top complex housing\n            addBlueprintPart(new THREE.BoxGeometry(5, 3, 4), {x: 0, y: 4.5, z: 0});\n            addBlueprintPart(new THREE.TorusGeometry(1.5, 0.5, 16, 32), {x: 2.5, y: 4.5, z: 0}, {x: 0, y: Math.PI/2, z: 0});\n\n            // Angled arm/shaft\n            addBlueprintPart(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(0.5, 0.8, 8, 16), {x: -4, y: 3, z: 0}, {x: 0, y: 0, z: Math.PI/4});\n            addBlueprintPart(new THREE.BoxGeometry(2, 2, 2), {x: -7, y: 6, z: 0}, {x: 0, y: 0, z: Math.PI/4});\n\n            // Lower attachment / heat sink\n            for(let i=0; i<5; i++) {\n                addBlueprintPart(new THREE.BoxGeometry(4, 0.2, 4), {x: 0, y: -3 - (i*0.5), z: 0});\n            }\n            addBlueprintPart(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(1.5, 2.5, 3, 32), {x: -3, y: -4, z: 0}, {x: 0, y: 0, z: -Math.PI/6});\n\n            // Pipes/Tubes\n            const path = new THREE.CatmullRomCurve3([\n                new THREE.Vector3(-1, 0, 2),\n                new THREE.Vector3(-3, 1, 2.5),\n                new THREE.Vector3(-4, -2, 1)\n            ]);\n            const tubeGeo = new THREE.TubeGeometry(path, 20, 0.3, 8, false);\n            addBlueprintPart(tubeGeo);\n\n            // Add the entire assembly to scene\n            scene.add(mechGroup);\n\n            // Initial rotation to match a good viewing angle\n            mechGroup.rotation.x = 0.3;\n            mechGroup.rotation.y = -0.5;\n\n            // Mouse interaction for subtle parallax\n            let mouseX = 0;\n            let mouseY = 0;\n            let targetX = 0;\n            let targetY = 0;\n            const windowHalfX = window.innerWidth / 2;\n            const windowHalfY = window.innerHeight / 2;\n\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (event) => {\n                mouseX = (event.clientX - windowHalfX);\n                mouseY = (event.clientY - windowHalfY);\n            });\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n            const animate = () => {\n                requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n\n                const delta = clock.getDelta();\n\n                // Slow continuous rotation\n                mechGroup.rotation.y += 0.002;\n                mechGroup.rotation.z -= 0.001;\n\n                // Subtle mouse-follow parallax\n                targetX = mouseX * 0.001;\n                targetY = mouseY * 0.001;\n                mechGroup.rotation.y += 0.05 * (targetX - mechGroup.rotation.y);\n                mechGroup.rotation.x += 0.05 * (targetY - mechGroup.rotation.x);\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n            };\n\n            animate();\n\n            // Handle Resize\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.position.z = window.innerWidth < 768 ? 25 : 18;\n                camera.position.x = window.innerWidth < 768 ? 0 : -2;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n        };\n\n        // --- GSAP ANIMATIONS (Masked Reveal) ---\n        const initGSAP = () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // Staggered word reveal for main typography\n            const words = gsap.utils.toArray('.reveal-word');\n\n            // Initial load animation + tied to scroll so it replays if scrolled out and back\n            words.forEach((word, i) => {\n                gsap.to(word, {\n                    y: '0%',\n                    duration: 1.2,\n                    ease: \"power4.out\",\n                    delay: 0.2 + (i * 0.15),\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: word.parentElement,\n                        start: \"top 90%\",\n                        toggleActions: \"play none none reverse\"\n                    }\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Parallax effect on the yellow block\n            gsap.to('.bg-brand-yellow', {\n                yPercent: 10,\n                ease: \"none\",\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \"body\",\n                    start: \"top top\",\n                    end: \"bottom top\",\n                    scrub: true\n                }\n            });\n        };\n\n        // Initialize when DOM is ready\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            // Fallback check for WebGL\n            try {\n                initThreeJS();\n            } catch (e) {\n                console.warn(\"ThreeJS initialization failed, falling back to static layout.\", e);\n                document.getElementById('mech-canvas').style.display = 'none';\n                // Could append a static SVG fallback here if desired\n            }\n            initGSAP();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "a9-dynamics-engineering.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/a9-dynamics-engineering.jpg", "source_name": "a9-dynamics-engineering-DESIGN.md", "views": 89, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "2e815afb-cac1-4c01-90e1-cf3810246e35", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T08:24:38.86062+00:00"}